{"guid":"wa-1to1-+17033085648-74","timestamp_unix_ms":1775059730853,"direction":"outgoing","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Long does not come back till the day before; so, it will be impossible for her to introduce him, for she will not know him herself.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"wa-1to1-+17033085648-75","timestamp_unix_ms":1776053078853,"direction":"incoming","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+17033085648","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"She was _now_ struck with the impropriety of such communications to a stranger, and wondered it had escaped her before.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"wa-1to1-+17033085648-76","timestamp_unix_ms":1776073084853,"direction":"outgoing","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"She was very wrong in singling me out as she did; I can safely say, that every advance to intimacy began on her side.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"wa-1to1-+17033085648-77","timestamp_unix_ms":1783158696853,"direction":"outgoing","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Bennet, as soon as they were out of the house, \"as ever I saw.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"wa-1to1-+17033085648-78","timestamp_unix_ms":1783163174853,"direction":"incoming","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+17033085648","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"My aunt,\" she continued, \"is going to-morrow into that part of the town, and I shall take the opportunity of calling in Grosvenor Street.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"wa-1to1-+17033085648-79","timestamp_unix_ms":1783167495853,"direction":"outgoing","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"At Brighton she will be of less importance even as a common flirt than she has been here. Darcy looked just as he had been used to look in Hertfordshire, paid his compliments, with his usual reserve, to Mrs.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
